    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It’s a lens for\nscoping out weak points. It boosts the holder’s\ncritical-hit ratio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "弱点が　みえる　レンズ。\n持たせた　ポケモンの　技が\n急所に　当たりやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能看见弱点的镜片。\n携带它的宝可梦的招式\n会变得容易击中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Su lente aumenta la probabilidad que tiene el Pokémon\nque lo lleva de conseguir un golpe crítico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
